1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,537
Rendering is deterministic.

2
00:00:02,537 --> 00:00:06,975
Vigo opens each scene in headless Chromium and freezes time.

3
00:00:06,975 --> 00:00:15,887
It pauses and seeks every CSS and Web Animation, seeks video elements, then calls your optional vigo dot seek hook.

4
00:00:15,887 --> 00:00:21,137
Every frame is captured at an exact timestamp, so repeated renders match.

